SUMMARY:April Macie LIVE at Brad Garrett's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nApril Macie LIVE at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nStand-up comedian April Macie headlines Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club inside MGM Grand in Las Vegas on August 25\, 2026. Known for her fearless\, no-holds-barred comedy style\, April brings her unique brand of humor to the Strip for a night of unforgettable laughs alongside Brad Garrett. \nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday\, August 25\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3799 Las Vegas Blvd South\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109 (inside MGM Grand)\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid photo ID\nParking: MGM Grand parking available \nAbout April Macie\nApril Macie is a stand-up comedian best known for her appearance on NBC’s Last Comic Standing\, where she became a fan favorite with her bold\, edgy humor. She has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the country and has built a devoted following for her fearless\, no-filter approach to stand-up comedy. April’s material draws from real life with sharp wit and infectious energy. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHeadlining stand-up set by April Macie\nSpecial appearance by Brad Garrett\nIntimate showroom setting inside MGM Grand\nBold\, fearless\, no-filter comedy\n18+ show with adult humor\nBest available seating within purchased zone\n\nVenue Information\nBrad Garrett’s Comedy Club is located inside the MGM Grand Hotel & Casino on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering a premium comedy experience in an intimate setting with excellent sightlines and a lively atmosphere. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $86. Seating is best available within the zone purchased — seats are not assigned until arrival. There is an overall 8-ticket limit per order. All performers subject to change without notice. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/april-macie-live-at-brad-garretts-comedy-club/
