SUMMARY:Roy Wood Jr. LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nRoy Wood Jr. is one of the most respected and versatile comedians working today. Best known as a longtime correspondent on The Daily Show with Trevor Noah\, Roy has earned Emmy nominations for his work and has established himself as a sharp\, insightful voice in both stand-up comedy and political satire. \nRoy’s stand-up comedy is rooted in his Southern upbringing\, his observations on race and culture in America\, and his ability to find humor in the most unexpected places. His specials\, including Father Figure and Impersonating Myself\, have been critically acclaimed and showcase his remarkable range as a storyteller and comedian. \nBeyond The Daily Show\, Roy has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Conan\, Late Night with Seth Meyers\, and numerous other television programs. He is also an Emmy-nominated documentary producer\, adding another dimension to his already impressive creative portfolio. \nEvent Details\nDates: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026 & Friday\, August 28\, 2026 \nShow Times: Aug 27 at 6:30 PM & 8:30 PM HST | Aug 28 at 6:30 PM HST \nVenue: Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Ave\, Honolulu\, HI 96815 \nClub Policy: $20 food or beverage minimum per person. Seating is first come\, first served. Full bar and full dinner menu available. \nAbout the Venue\nBlue Note Hawaii is Honolulu’s most celebrated intimate live entertainment venue\, nestled inside the Outrigger Waikiki Beach Resort at 2335 Kalakaua Avenue in the heart of Waikiki. The venue is renowned for its world-class acoustics\, intimate atmosphere\, and exceptional dining and bar service. \nWith seating options ranging from Premium Seating to Loge Seating & Bar Area\, every guest enjoys an up-close experience with the performer. The venue’s warm\, sophisticated ambiance makes it the perfect setting for a special night out in Waikiki. \nBlue Note Hawaii is located steps from Waikiki Beach\, making it easy to combine a comedy show with a beautiful Hawaiian evening. Parking is available at the Outrigger Waikiki Beach Resort and nearby public parking structures. \nWhat to Expect\nRoy Wood Jr.’s shows at Blue Note Hawaii will be an intimate\, thought-provoking comedy experience. Having performed on some of the biggest stages in comedy\, Roy brings his full headline set to the intimate Blue Note Hawaii stage for a rare up-close experience. \nExpect sharp political and social commentary delivered with Roy’s signature warmth and Southern charm. His shows are known for their intelligence\, accessibility\, and ability to make audiences laugh while also making them think about the world around them. \nThree shows are available across two nights\, giving fans multiple opportunities to catch this Emmy-nominated comedian. Tickets are expected to sell out quickly given Roy’s national profile and the intimate capacity of Blue Note Hawaii. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $91 (resale market) \nSecure your seats now through the official ticket link or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/roy-wood-jr-live-at-blue-note-hawaii/
LOCATION:Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI\, 96815\, United States
GEO:21.2771844;-157.8275909
