SUMMARY:Greg Fitzsimmons LIVE at Funny Bone Comedy Club - Columbus
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nGreg Fitzsimmons LIVE at Funny Bone Comedy Club – Columbus\nEmmy Award-winning comedian and podcast host Greg Fitzsimmons brings his razor-sharp wit and brutally honest stand-up to the Funny Bone Comedy Club in Columbus\, Ohio for one night only on August 27\, 2026. Known for his no-holds-barred style and fearless storytelling\, this is a must-see night of comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026\nTime: Doors 5:30 PM / Show 7:00 PM\nVenue: Funny Bone Comedy Club – Columbus\nAddress: 145 Easton Town Center\, Columbus\, OH 43219\nAge Requirement: Ages 21 and up\nParking: Available at Easton Town Center \nAbout Greg Fitzsimmons\nGreg Fitzsimmons is an Emmy Award-winning writer and stand-up comedian who has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Late Show with David Letterman\, and Conan. He is the host of the popular podcast “FitzDog Radio” and has written for Howard Stern\, Ellen DeGeneres\, and many other major TV shows. His stand-up is known for being raw\, honest\, and hilariously self-deprecating. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, no-holds-barred stand-up comedy from a seasoned pro\nBrutally honest observations on marriage\, family\, and everyday life\nAn intimate club setting at one of Columbus’s premier comedy venues\nFull bar and dining available at the Funny Bone\nA night of laughs you won’t forget\n\nVenue Information\nThe Funny Bone Comedy Club – Columbus is located in the heart of Easton Town Center\, offering a premier comedy club experience with full bar service\, dining\, and an intimate stage setting perfect for stand-up comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $27 to $32. Resale tickets are also available. Secure your seats early as this show is expected to sell out. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/greg-fitzsimmons-live-at-funny-bone-comedy-club-columbus/
