SUMMARY:Phil Medina LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nPhil Medina LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nPowerhouse headlining comedian Phil Medina is coming to Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa for a night of non-stop laughs. Known for his high-energy performances and sharp comedic instincts\, Medina has headlined top clubs across the country and is ready to bring the house down in Tulsa. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234\, Tulsa\, OK 74133\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Price: $20 \nAbout Phil Medina\nPhil Medina is a powerhouse headlining comedian who has performed at top clubs including the Laugh Factory\, Hollywood Improv\, and the Ice House. With a high-energy style that blends sharp wit with crowd-pleasing humor\, Medina has built a reputation as one of the most entertaining live performers on the national comedy circuit. His relatable material and dynamic stage presence make every show an unforgettable experience. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy headlining stand-up comedy\nSharp wit and crowd-pleasing humor\nRelatable material drawn from real-life experiences\nIntimate comedy club setting at Loony Bin Tulsa\nFull bar and dining available throughout the show\n\nVenue Information\nLoony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa at 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234 offers an intimate comedy experience where no seat is more than 50 feet from the stage. Enjoy food and drinks while you laugh the night away. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Phil Medina at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa are just $20. Purchase directly through the Loony Bin website. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
