SUMMARY:Lance Woods LIVE at Punch Line Philly
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nLance Woods is a standout comedian known for his sharp\, observational humor and his ability to find comedy in the everyday moments of life. With a style that is both relatable and refreshingly honest\, Woods has built a loyal following of fans who appreciate his authentic\, no-frills approach to stand-up comedy. \nWoods has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the country\, earning a reputation as a consistently funny and engaging live performer. His material covers a wide range of topics — from relationships and family dynamics to social observations and personal experiences — all delivered with the kind of timing and confidence that comes from years of honing his craft on stage. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan or catching him for the first time\, Lance Woods delivers the kind of stand-up set that reminds you why live comedy is one of the best nights out you can have. His Philadelphia stop at Punch Line Philly is shaping up to be a must-see show of the summer. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM EDT \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restriction: 21+ with 2-beverage minimum \nTicket Prices: Starting from $25 (plus fees) \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s go-to destination for world-class stand-up comedy\, situated at 33 E. Laurel Street in the heart of the Northern Liberties neighborhood. The club accommodates approximately 300 guests in an intimate\, table-seating layout that puts every audience member close to the action. \nThe venue features a full-service bar\, attentive staff\, and a warm\, energetic atmosphere that makes every show feel like a special occasion. The acoustics and sight lines are excellent throughout the room\, ensuring a premium experience no matter where you’re seated. \nPunch Line Philly is conveniently located near public transit options and has parking available in nearby lots and garages. Doors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showtime — arrive early to get the best seats and enjoy a drink before the show kicks off. \nWhat to Expect\nLance Woods brings a grounded\, authentic energy to the stage that immediately connects with audiences. His set is a well-crafted mix of sharp one-liners\, longer storytelling bits\, and crowd-pleasing observations that build to big laughs throughout the evening. \nThe show will feature an opening act followed by Lance Woods’s full headlining performance. It’s the perfect mid-week comedy night — a chance to unwind\, laugh hard\, and enjoy a great show in one of Philly’s best intimate venues. \nThis is a 21+ event with a two-beverage minimum. Tickets are available now — don’t sleep on this one\, as Punch Line Philly shows regularly sell out. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $25 – $55 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Book your seats today! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/lance-woods-live-at-punch-line-philly/
LOCATION:Punch Line Philly\, 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 19123\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/41bdbe6a-9cca-48eb-b55d-66b49d8f94af_CUSTOM-LHS4eZ.jpg
