SUMMARY:Gabriel Fluffy Iglesias LIVE at Ilani Cowlitz Ballroom
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nGabriel Fluffy Iglesias LIVE at Ilani Cowlitz Ballroom\nOne of the most beloved stand-up comedians in the world\, Gabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias\, is bringing his legendary live show to the Ilani Cowlitz Ballroom in Ridgefield\, Washington on August 27\, 2026. Known for his infectious energy\, hilarious storytelling\, and iconic sound effects\, Fluffy delivers a show that leaves audiences in tears of laughter. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Ilani Cowlitz Ballroom\nAddress: 1 Cowlitz Way\, Ridgefield\, WA 98642\nAge Requirement: All Ages \nAbout Gabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias\nGabriel Iglesias\, affectionately known as “Fluffy\,” is one of America’s most successful stand-up comedians and actors. He has sold out arenas worldwide\, released multiple hit Netflix specials including “Stadium Fluffy\,” and starred in the hit TV series Mr. Iglesias. His comedy blends personal stories\, cultural observations\, and masterful character voices that connect with audiences of all backgrounds. With over 20 million social media followers\, Fluffy is a true comedy phenomenon. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWorld-class stand-up comedy from one of the biggest names in the business\nHilarious stories about family\, food\, culture\, and everyday life\nGabriel’s signature sound effects and character voices\nHigh-energy performance that keeps the laughs coming all night\nA premium casino ballroom experience at ilani Resort\nAn unforgettable night of feel-good\, inclusive comedy\n\nVenue Information\nThe Ilani Cowlitz Ballroom is a premier entertainment venue located at the ilani Casino Resort in Ridgefield\, Washington\, just north of Portland. The venue offers excellent sightlines\, top-notch sound\, and a full-service casino resort experience with dining and accommodations on-site. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $120. Available through official Ticketmaster channels and resale marketplaces. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gabriel-fluffy-iglesias-live-at-ilani-cowlitz-ballroom/
